{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109470/extras/insi_cover2.png?t=1747747640\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109470/extras/prologuetitle.png?t=1747747640\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On a day in September 2024, student Ji Wang welcomes his new deskmate: TONO.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">TONO's arrival brings vibrant colors to Ji Wang's monotonous life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The 100-Day Oath Ceremony, study tours, English Festival, graduation... The college entrance exam approaches silently amidst daily routines. Before he knows it, Ji Wang finds himself holding his exam admission ticket at the gates of the testing center.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109470/extras/introtitle.png?t=1747747640\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TONO</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109470/extras/tono.png?t=1747747640\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ji Wang's new deskmate, initially perceived as a &quot;humanities genius.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Actually struggles with rote memorization but surprisingly loves joking around. Enjoys collecting pink accessories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MORI</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109470/extras/mori.png?t=1747747640\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The class-recognized academic ace. Excels in humanities and math, yet seemingly weak in English.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Loves anime, 2D mobile games, and RTS games. Rumored to be an avid Six Kingdoms player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>LIPERA</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109470/extras/lipera.png?t=1747747640\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Attends Mi'sa City First Iron High School. Reportedly already admitted to a prestigious university, often seen standing at the observatory gate near Mi'sa Experimental.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Struggles with humanities but eagerly learns new things. Prefers physical books over e-books.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109470/extras/more.png?t=1747747640\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Every character features rich branch stories</strong> to explore throughout the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109470/extras/gp.png?t=1747747640\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tap to advance the storyline!</strong> Whether chatting, solving problems, or browsing videos, every choice may unlock bonus scenarios!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109470/extras/misatitle.png?t=1747747640\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Liangpi! Roujiamo! And Mi'sa's iconic &quot;Icce Peek&quot; sparkling drink\u2014</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a Mi'sa City journey that begins in one summer and ends in another.</p><p c